       so it applies to every camera in the scene; NO CLI command sets a
       per-camera distortion model. The former per-camera split (fisheye
       division / rectilinear brown3) was only ever reachable through XMP
       calibration sidecars, and those were removed in favour of
       -setPriorCalibrationGroup / -setPriorLensGroup (modules/
       prior_groups.py), which carry group identity but NOT distortion.
       Division is universal and is what ships. See
       docs/settings-evaluation-2026-07.md. -->
